      "text": "Heat a pan and add oil. Add methi seeds, cumin and dry red chilly. Stir and add heeng. Give a quick stir and add the curd mixture. Stir continuously till it gets a boil. Now lower the heat and let it cook for half hour, keep stirring in between so that it does not stick to the bottom.",
